;; Campaign play only (level/campaign.ts applyLook): Link's tribute, 2-1 as a Zelda II field: the
;; same tiles, enemies, coins and collision in the `zelda2` theme and music, its trees and clouds
;; as forest and flat clouds, with standing stones on the field ([campaign-decor]). Elsewhere
;; (level select, ?level=2-1) it looks as it always did.
campaignTheme: zelda2
campaignMusic: zelda2-field

