;; Campaign only (0.4.10, the Top Secret Area): a hidden block high over the bricks, found by jumping
;; back up-left off the hidden coin block (186,5), lays a cloud path from the last tower toward the
;; flagpole; jump over the pole without touching it and walk on past the
;; castle into the cave at the level's end (2-1-cave, where the Moblin tells his secret).
;; The same bump first lays two one-way cloud steps back up to the bricks (0.4.12), one over the
;; ground and one beside the bricks, so a hero who comes down from the jump finds his way up again
;; (a jump from under them passes through).
path 183 10 1 block=184,0 one-way campaign
path 184 9 1 block=184,0 one-way campaign
path 192 3 7 block=184,0 campaign
;; Campaign only (0.4.12): a one-way cloud ledge against the last tower, a row over the bricks' top
;; and three under the hidden coin block's, for a hero with a fixed jump arc (Simon): he hops onto it
;; off the bricks or lands on it coming down from the springboard (whose launch rises through it),
;; and jumps from it onto the hidden coin block's top. Too low for any hero to reach the hidden
;; block from it.
ledge 188 8 2 campaign
pipe 224 11 right -> 2-1-cave 1 12 campaign

